# Normalize line endings so a checkout is byte-identical on every machine.
#
# This box has `core.autocrlf=true`, so without this file a fresh checkout rewrites
# every LF to CRLF in the working tree. That silently broke the E3 mutation set:
# patterns that span lines with `\n` stopped matching the CRLF source, and the
# mutation harness reads the working tree verbatim (`readFileSync`). Pin LF and the
# tree the harness reads is the tree that was committed, everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git might misdetect — never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
